    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.poster.avif?t=1624286325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.webm?t=1624286325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.mp4?t=1624286325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Planet Surf: The Last Wave</strong> is a physics/arcade/surf game on space! The ultimate surf trip!<br><br>Ride the planet's last wave while dodging deadly meteors! You have 3 minutes to collect enough energy crystals before the planet explodes.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ride endless waves!<br></li><li>Dodge deadly meteors!<br></li><li>Surf in <strong>unique planets</strong>!<br></li><li>Beat your friend's score with <strong>planet specific leaderboards</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Original soundtrack</strong>!<br></li><li>Become the best surfer in the galaxy!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.poster.avif?t=1624286325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.webm?t=1624286325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612030/extras/465db2d234d3b774fc7f6d00e26e6b23.mp4?t=1624286325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Planet Surf: The Last Wave</strong> is a physics/arcade/surf game on space! The ultimate surf trip!<br><br>Ride the planet's last wave while dodging deadly meteors! You have 3 minutes to collect enough energy crystals before the planet explodes.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ride endless waves!<br></li><li>Dodge deadly meteors!<br></li><li>Surf in <strong>unique planets</strong>!<br></li><li>Beat your friend's score with <strong>planet specific leaderboards</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Original soundtrack</strong>!<br></li><li>Become the best surfer in the galaxy!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "It's space surf season, year 2183. And as usual, the planet is about to explode! You have only 3 minutes to surf its last wave, get enough energy crystals for your hyper-foil board to get you out in one piece. Will you be able to make it to the next planet?",
